Build an Expo React Native app (TypeScript, expo-sqlite, offline-only).

CORE SCREEN: Search bar at top. User types a clinical problem 
(e.g., "hyperkalemia", "DKA", "chest pain"). App shows:

1. Definition (1 line)
2. Severity assessment (based on values user can optionally enter)
3. Step-by-step management with:
   - Drug name (generic + Pakistani brand)
   - Dose
   - Route
   - Frequency
   - Key monitoring points
4. When to escalate to senior
5. Source: "Doctor On Duty 2021, Ch. X"

